  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "38d074c6-b12a-4348-b661-4713f4624a8d",
      "footerLinks": [
        {
          "name": "Link 1",
          "target": "_blank",
          "udi": "umb://document/22a4a3efd9d74129b573ea9a707040b3"
        },
        {
          "name": "Link 2",
          "target": "_blank",
          "udi": "umb://document/449dad988cd84579be6be4a5868e4baa"
        }
      ],
      "heading": "",
      "udi": "umb://element/53702da3d63746a0b8713ad070b50b6d"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "394dc214-e2ad-4605-ab3f-2c6b83063ef6",
      "text": "Search results",
      "udi": "umb://element/e318a2f861c84c61845af5b09f044654"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>The search results component can be added to any page where you want the user to be able to search the Q&amp;A content accessible on The Pensions Regulator website. Currently this is focused on Q&amp;As for Automatic Enrolment.</p>\n<p>The following elements can be overridden in content section of the component in Umbraco</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Heading</li>\n<li>Footer links</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Footer links will always contain a <strong>'Show more questions'</strong> link, that will show the remaining three questions, two are shown when the page loads.</p>\n<p>The following elements can be overridden in settings section of the component in Umbraco</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Heading level</li>\n<li>Heading class</li>\n<li>CSS classes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This component should be accompanied with a <strong>link, styled as a button</strong> component using the CSS class <strong>tpr-search-results-nav-button</strong>. When clicked, it should navigate the user to the search results section on the page.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/dde55b0fb5114956a211166d73b921a8"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "94737fb0-c49c-44db-8a59-6a65f14a0c47",
      "link": [
        {
          "name": "",
          "target": "_blank",
          "url": "https://www.thepensionsregulator.gov.uk/faq-landing-page"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Search Q&As",
      "udi": "umb://element/8f12d494721643db8ec75abedb7b3c6e"
    },
    {
      "caption": "Example application in Umbraco",
      "contentTypeKey": "bfeed15c-3ebb-46d4-b805-07d0f9b083c7",
      "udi": "umb://element/ba02a710f69943efba9554fe54bf9b3f"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "d7921903-6c44-4c50-bef9-7def4b21fae4",
      "udi": "umb://element/3dc05e0af44142b09909b7e51f8f26f2"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "40bb2a3e-3d75-4ec1-9134-e0c46c6f04a0",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>&lt;script src=\"_Content/ThePensionsRegulator.Frontend/tpr/tpr-search-results.js\" type=\"module\"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/7ddd5f859941435a9cdc16fe40fc94f4"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>If JavaScript is not available then this component will not display and the accompanying button should take the user to the Q&amp;A landing page in a new tab.</p>\n<p>Users have shared that they appreciate not losing their place on the original page and opening links in a new tab offers a similar, seamless experience.</p>\n<h2 class=\"govuk-heading-m\">Configuration</h2>\n<p>Three URLs are required to be configured to allow this component to show content.</p>\n<p><strong>PopularContentUrl</strong><br>This should return a list of content to show when the page loads. The example app provides an example of the expected structure</p>\n<p><strong>ContentByIdUrl</strong><br>This should return a singular result and allow the id of the item to be appended to the URL. The example app provides an example of the expected structure</p>\n<p><strong>SearchContentUrl</strong><br>This should return a list of keys that can be retrieved by id. The example app provides an example of the expected structure</p>\n<p>These are configured via the&nbsp;<strong>appsettings.json</strong> under a section named&nbsp; <strong>SearchResultsApiEndpoints</strong></p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/a42a115ae7b94a13808dbe45c12dea97"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "83cb35fb-51da-45cd-913f-1b8bdfd6a1d9",
      "iconFallbackText": "",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p><em>This component relies on JavaScript to display content.</em></p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/da5a27625f5342fc8d6b45ae9c74e14f"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "40bb2a3e-3d75-4ec1-9134-e0c46c6f04a0",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<div>\"SearchResultsApiEndpoints\": {</div>\n<div><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"ContentByIdUrl\": \"/SearchResultsData/\",</span></div>\n<div><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"SearchContentUrl\": \"/SearchResultsData/searchResults.json\",</span></div>\n<div><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"PopularContentUrl\": \"/SearchResultsData/popularContentExample.json\"</span></div>\n<div>}</div>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/3d98765597fb4f86bc031b748a7b772c"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>The JavaScript file <strong>'tpr-search-results.js'</strong> is provided as part of the <strong>'ThePensionsRegulator.Frontend'</strong> nuget package. This will need to be included in any view that uses this component.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/5be88fe5342749e795c85a211fa350db"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "5d33cd38-b819-4afd-9d4a-499ee73799ab",
      "udi": "umb://element/64d518ae9d3e4fe38f0fa7bdeb044d37"
    }
  ],
